Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:55.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,《赌博默示录2》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们为了活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.16,0:00:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,“推人下去”是理所应当的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们推开旁人 装模作样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.47,0:00:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,说教
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就职
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.18,0:00:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,从入职开始的地位之争
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.45,0:00:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据以上成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.05,0:00:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,授予“沼泽”店长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条圣也以会长奖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么年轻就得到会长奖 好年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是从铁骨桥上活下来的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.13,0:01:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,会长对你相当的期待
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的光荣，感激不尽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.77,0:01:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定不辜负您的…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个人…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.31,0:01:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.65,0:01:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个过了桥的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.55,0:01:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个男人的话… 据说还在为了债务
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.05,0:01:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为地下王国建设的劳动力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一次送回到地下劳动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.79,0:01:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊藤开司…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.26,0:01:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思的男人呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.70,0:01:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.13,0:01:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了活下去推人是理所应当的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.59,0:02:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我推了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.69,0:02:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.37,0:02:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,又像现在这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.57,0:02:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.91,0:02:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 啊 没点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.92,0:02:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,又像现在这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,和开司一起掷骰子了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬到地上了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到一年又回到这来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.03,0:02:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好开心… 我很开心哟 开司君
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 没点 庄家赢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.47,0:02:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠…怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好惨啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,走霉运的时候呢 会被赌盅抛弃的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.48,0:03:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怜呐…可怜啊开司
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气马上就来了 绝对会赢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.25,0:03:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的全部
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,10万零300倍利卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该不会不知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里赌金的上限是多少
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开吧 最后的胜负了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏毛病哟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.31,0:03:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一头脑发热就会 失去自我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘛…我是庄家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就用宽容 的精神接受你的自杀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.35,0:03:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,特例去掉 上限
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.19,0:03:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.66,0:03:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部359万倍利卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:03:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！你们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.70,0:04:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受吧 大规
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.94,0:04:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,被这样不走运的 垃圾沾了晦气怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么想都是我赢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.14,0:04:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呀 可是受胜负女神青睐的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,被特别选出来的啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.22,0:04:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘻 啊 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！你们干嘛 放手放手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对路啊 快看这些骰子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有一二三 只有四五六
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,四五六骰子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊啊，拿错了拿错了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,完了 啊 不是的 不是的 啊啊啊，拿错了拿错了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.97,0:04:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是做了个这么个玩意…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别装蒜了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.84,0:04:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,出老千的惩罚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,出老千罚4倍 全部给我吐出来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.22,0:04:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是多亏了开司啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我一生都要做班长的奴隶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.76,0:04:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 都是多亏了开司
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦.不应该是多亏了 你的笔记
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.76,0:05:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 什么笔记！ 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,三好他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,半年来 一直记录着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,才发现了你的老千
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂还钱啊 全部
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.44,0:05:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你出千骗大家的钱全部吐出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.61,0:05:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部吐出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.41,0:05:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是啊 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.09,0:05:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能逃出地下了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.69,0:05:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家能自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼…勤劳奖励选项表…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使用了这些钱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.57,0:05:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,送你们所有人 一天外出
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸新鲜空气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.77,0:05:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是一次中学生的旅行嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.81,0:05:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 如你所说 所以我们决定
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.11,0:05:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让一个出去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们决定堵上一切
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:05:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了开司
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:06:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了开司
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.58,0:06:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,要把这两样东西带在身上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.75,0:06:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,到达地上为止之前
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你先睡会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑崎大人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.49,0:06:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让利根川失势的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.66,0:06:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,典型的野狗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.17,0:06:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你啊 托我的福取代了利根川 地位的干部
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.11,0:06:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,住口
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.61,0:06:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到地上的14天自由时间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.38,0:07:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及现金109万5千
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.95,0:07:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么，两周要赚多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.69,0:07:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,2亿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,25人份的债务总和
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.49,0:07:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和大家将获得解放
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.89,0:07:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼哼哼哼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么样的梦话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这地下出去这两星期
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我记住
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.41,0:07:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,违背常理的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.48,0:07:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能性是零
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会赢的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.58,0:07:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.19,0:08:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,地上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.81,0:08:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能磨磨蹭蹭的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,用109万两周内变成2亿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约是184倍
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.66,0:08:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以不断的买万马券
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 概率太低了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能说是百分之百
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少是一半一半
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.64,0:09:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之50的概率才合逻辑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.74,0:09:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要找个目标
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.48,0:09:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,又像现在这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 好吃 到底是地上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急投宿券
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要的顾客， 没有领到挂号的顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.53,0:09:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.86,0:09:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 别急
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.23,0:09:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 今晚有住处了 哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.67,0:09:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们输了又输才沦落到现在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.91,0:09:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你也是垃圾 失败的就是垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,吵死了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.85,0:09:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,废物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,利根川
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.00,0:10:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊藤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.74,0:10:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.54,0:10:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,109万变2亿？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.34,0:10:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.25,0:10:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只考虑你自己的欠款就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.15,0:10:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是应该沦落到地下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.56,0:10:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.30,0:10:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇者之路
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.27,0:10:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.27,0:10:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.11,0:10:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀念得要流泪了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:10:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你TMD
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.75,0:10:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,该不会忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,能解气的话尽管打吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.73,0:11:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.87,0:11:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看这样怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,要与久别重逢的我赌一把吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.30,0:11:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么重要的钱 怎么能用来和你赌
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.37,0:11:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你赢了的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.51,0:11:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你一个特别的消息也是可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.64,0:11:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把109万
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成2亿的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不太会玩象棋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.93,0:11:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.67,0:11:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要这些就够
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.18,0:11:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.18,0:11:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:11:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝无虚言
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我是很强的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.09,0:12:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦开始了 就不能提前走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,走的话就算输哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋 谁会在比赛中那样做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 从我开始
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.41,0:12:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 还有 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了下这盘棋 还要跟你说一件重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.11,0:12:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一是勇气 二是胆量 三是觉悟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 这实际上很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在人生所有的决断中都会起作用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 一是勇气 二是胆量 三是觉悟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.86,0:12:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别喋喋不休了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.30,0:12:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.93,0:12:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这话是 为了让我急躁的战术吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别小瞧我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:13:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,登记号98号的顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,98号的顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.58,0:13:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,住宿券啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,暖和毛毯 暖器
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.22,0:13:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,热水
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,像今天这种天气 可能会冻死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.76,0:13:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到你下棋了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.66,0:13:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,98号客人在不在？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.97,0:13:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊我在 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的很快就回来 可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.57,0:13:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这等我 很快
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,利根川
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.19,0:13:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱没了 诶？我的钱不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.53,0:13:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个混蛋 利根川
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.60,0:13:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 去哪了利根川
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.27,0:14:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.61,0:14:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是一根筋的老样子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.67,0:14:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钱还我你这混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,最初讲好的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,中途离开就算输
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.48,0:14:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊！ 混蛋把诓我的钱还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.45,0:14:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太卑鄙了 还给我 我的5万
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.85,0:14:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，大概是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为特别奖励告诉你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看象棋盘的下面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,通往帝爱特别赌场的邀请函
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,奋力挑战吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,向着那里的奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,连个招牌都没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.62,0:15:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,客人是第一次光临本店吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.99,0:15:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.77,0:15:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,例行公事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.99,0:16:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里面有这么大的赌场
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.06,0:16:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,最低是5万
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,10万
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,100万的桌子都有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.76,0:16:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里可行 有运气的话就行得通
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.91,0:16:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏青哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.89,0:16:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,小哥第一次来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？ 嫌我烦？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.53,0:16:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是在警戒我呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.83,0:16:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是很亲切的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.43,0:16:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.84,0:16:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,平常的柏青哥 一发是4元对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.91,0:16:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.81,0:16:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有40元一发的 400元一发的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.44,0:16:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:16:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,都来到这里了 当然是选100倍的咯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,小哥更不用说了 带你看样有趣的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.09,0:17:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个赌场的看家招牌 最大的卖点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.72,0:17:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千倍的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.53,0:17:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千倍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.49,0:17:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说打一发就4千元！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？也就是说赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.07,0:17:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,吐出来的钱也是一千倍咯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:17:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,从上面开始的每一发
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看那个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.01,0:18:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要经过钉子丛林
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,三道连续的轮盘
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.68,0:18:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能有一发进入最后的红洞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.25,0:18:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,到此为止积累的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.68,0:18:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的钢珠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.85,0:18:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那脚下所有的钢珠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.69,0:18:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部都能获得！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.43,0:18:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.10,0:18:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共值多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.76,0:18:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个箱子里 每一条线都相当于一个亿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,中了的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.94,0:18:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是11亿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.64,0:18:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好历害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.94,0:18:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真有人曾经中过11亿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.58,0:18:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看那个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,兵藤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.25,0:18:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个是 之前的那个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可思议呐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能这么容易就中呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个吃人沼泽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.23,0:18:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,沼泽？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.89,0:18:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,第3层了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.39,0:18:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊 冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,第3层，这是你的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.67,0:19:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊 冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去 进去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不还没完
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.32,0:19:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.09,0:19:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小哥也志在必得呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.16,0:19:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,投入了全部财产 直到借债为止
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.37,0:19:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,何等的愚蠢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.01,0:19:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下ATM
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.51,0:19:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有卡在手 就可以借到1千万
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.25,0:19:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千万！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.68,0:19:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然是一千万 闭店之前
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.05,0:19:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不还上的话就要被拉去强制劳动了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.95,0:19:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一个新人咯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:19:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也有吗 那张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.53,0:20:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 我没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了50岁是不能成为劳动力的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.16,0:20:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.10,0:20:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过小哥你还年轻 体力充沛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.00,0:20:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在入口处没拿一张吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.87,0:20:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没拿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.07,0:20:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘛…小哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.91,0:20:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看样子吃过很多苦头嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在停手的话 还有的救
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.69,0:20:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是停不了 为什么呢？？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.59,0:20:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻人怎么可能罢手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.06,0:20:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么执着啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.56,0:20:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要击沉他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.03,0:20:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄沉他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:21:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,第3层，这是你的选择
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.67,0:21:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.84,0:21:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样 那个小哥徒劳无功吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，可能是办不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.89,0:21:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.72,0:21:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.29,0:21:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正等你呢 伊藤开司
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个机器百分之百中不了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的筹码空了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.55,0:22:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，哦啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.76,0:22:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要 啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.96,0:22:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，也没有各位什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.61,0:22:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小哥 等我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.55,0:22:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之百不中是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.85,0:22:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三道轮盘中的 小球无一例外的都落了下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.08,0:22:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那台沼泽被店方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.45,0:22:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很自然地操纵着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.69,0:22:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是过去不是有2个人打中过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.66,0:22:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是帝爱的会长和干部
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.49,0:22:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕是为了钢珠的回收耍的把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.50,0:22:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个沼泽用一般的方法 是打不中的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.80,0:22:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.07,0:22:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你所说！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.43,0:22:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.94,0:22:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,反过来说，打中的办法 还是有的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.67,0:23:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，是的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.44,0:23:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果找出操纵的方法， 可以想到战略的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.44,0:23:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.04,0:23:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然英雄所见略同
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.21,0:23:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起来看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.72,0:23:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小哥可别吓一跳？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.32,0:23:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.13,0:23:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西都能做出来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.77,0:24:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,做出来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.13,0:24:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,做到这个地步
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.33,0:24:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是费了大把钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.24,0:24:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样，我是非常非常认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.94,0:24:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那台沼泽分个胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.41,0:24:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.38,0:24:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个，我的女儿美心
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.08,0:24:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样，美人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.32,0:24:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呀，别看这个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.79,0:24:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前可是工地的现场监督呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.59,0:24:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是，由于长期的不景气， 丢了工作
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.40,0:24:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,老婆孩子一声不吭的离家出走了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.00,0:24:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备一场无烟的战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.74,0:24:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了这11亿
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.41,0:24:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,老婆和孩子一定会回到我身边的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.31,0:24:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.65,0:24:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让你们回来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.75,0:24:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须打中那台沼泽
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.86,0:24:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了达到这个目的，我需要协助者
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.99,0:25:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,小哥， 作为男人我求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.36,0:25:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,能助我一臂之力吗？当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.83,0:25:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是免费的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.47,0:25:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,2千万怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.18,0:25:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.38,0:25:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫伊藤开司
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.55,0:25:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,阪崎孝太郎 开司，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.99,0:25:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.69,0:25:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有另一个同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.76,0:25:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次的行动 店内的协助者也是需要的撒
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.07,0:25:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.27,0:25:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下13天20小时
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.51,0:25:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了2千万的话，差不多可以拼一把了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.18,0:25:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,能搞到2亿
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.69,0:26:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司，我给你介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.69,0:26:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,安田…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.19,0:26:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,额…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.16,0:26:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真名是… 石田裕美
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.87,0:26:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.07,0:26:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔我们赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.41,0:26:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司君
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.07,0:26:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司君
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.24,0:26:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 托付给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.54,0:26:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我交给她
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.11,0:26:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.63,0:26:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,石田大叔的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.07,0:26:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个女孩是协助者？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.81,0:26:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶 开司
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.07,0:26:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样看人家女孩会紧张的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.21,0:26:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.08,0:27:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道背叛店里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.02,0:27:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 背叛帝爱
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.15,0:27:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是怎么一回事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.12,0:27:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说吗 你的事
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.50,0:27:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.97,0:27:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,被帝爱害死了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.41,0:27:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经知道了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.81,0:27:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲他被迫参加了帝爱组织的赌命游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.25,0:27:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,在游戏里去世了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.52,0:27:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能已经还清了债务
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.12,0:27:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,死的时候还带着笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.66,0:27:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那家赌场工作
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在等
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.60,0:27:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待复仇的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.91,0:28:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.35,0:28:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们3人合力
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.81,0:28:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.75,0:28:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要让帝爱付出代价
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.89,0:28:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.22,0:28:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我解释一下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.50,0:28:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是开司你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.74,0:28:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是裕美
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.07,0:28:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.97,0:28:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 还挺帅
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.91,0:28:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 开司一个人进入赌场
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.65,0:28:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,入口处
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.98,0:28:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会接受身体检查沼泽
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.35,0:28:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.52,0:28:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,打一个时间差
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.76,0:28:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提出挑战沼泽
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.40,0:28:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个时候只有我一个人 所以是安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.66,0:28:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.07,0:29:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.63,0:29:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要用个一千万
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.10,0:29:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,从开始就拼尽极限 极限的一千万
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.27,0:29:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,磨磨蹭蹭的掉下来也没意思
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.68,0:29:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,装载完成
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.12,0:29:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.45,0:29:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.85,0:29:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.39,0:29:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,请用
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.93,0:29:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,男子汉 阪崎孝太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.94,0:29:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这输了的话就玩完了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.91,0:29:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家 给我加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.14,0:29:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了的话 赏钱丰厚哟
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.88,0:29:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托各位了！！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.15,0:29:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.48,0:29:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽可能多地将赌客聚集到身边
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.35,0:29:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.26,0:29:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样准备工作就OK了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.66,0:30:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后的豪赌
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.07,0:30:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.10,0:30:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静一点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.91,0:30:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来一杯啤酒 请用
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.38,0:30:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.85,0:30:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,沼泽里面 有2个难关
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.05,0:30:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先是异常多的数量
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.26,0:30:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,排列的钉子森林
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.33,0:30:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,钉子森林？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.09,0:30:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是钉在内壁上的一片看的见的森林
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.76,0:30:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不被钉子的深渊吞没 是第一个关键
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.00,0:30:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是按照设定C调整过的钉距
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.94,0:30:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分日子里
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.08,0:30:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这的钉距是大部分钢珠都过不去的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.05,0:30:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.55,0:30:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个每月一次的 设定A的钉距
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.63,0:31:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.31,0:31:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.98,0:31:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是随便进
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.08,0:31:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是设定A的钉距调整
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.75,0:31:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.09,0:31:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果不确定这一天是几号的话 就没有意义了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.62,0:31:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.96,0:31:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了在那里登场
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.29,0:31:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要这个裕美 带给我的这个钉距调整的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.16,0:31:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定表
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.73,0:31:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.07,0:31:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个月的30号是设定A
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.00,0:31:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有奇迹发生的话 只会是在这一天
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.61,0:32:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,才刚刚开始打吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.58,0:32:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,钉林好轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.18,0:32:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,第1层
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.05,0:32:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,到此为止 都和大叔计划的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.86,0:32:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,突破了第一道关卡
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.26,0:32:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始时第二道关卡
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.72,0:32:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来 最大的难关
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.23,0:32:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个三连轮盘
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.00,0:32:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一道 是三个洞中有一个入赏洞
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.23,0:32:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二道是四个洞有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.33,0:32:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三道是五个洞有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.10,0:32:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个三连轮盘的 最终入赏概率是3乘4乘5
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.04,0:32:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是60分之1
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.34,0:32:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 不能只是依据概率行事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.35,0:32:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般来说 钢珠百分之百会进到别的洞里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.69,0:32:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.19,0:32:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果可以歪曲钢珠的轨道的话
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.15,0:33:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.45,0:33:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你看一下手法
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.40,0:33:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.56,0:33:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,磁铁？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.27,0:33:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那也太…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.40,0:33:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,太明目张胆了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.37,0:33:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.21,0:33:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要用这个
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.71,0:33:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,预先藏到
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.38,0:33:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个机关里
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.72,0:33:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个交给不用身体检查的裕美
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.32,0:33:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她交给开司你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.59,0:33:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后再给我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.96,0:33:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,装有磁铁的啤酒罐
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.53,0:33:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,磁力啤酒大作战！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.60,0:33:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 真的能顺利进行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.23,0:34:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个计划
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.30,0:34:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,第2层
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.80,0:34:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮拿一下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.22,0:34:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.49,0:34:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有暴露
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.27,0:34:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,第2层
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.97,0:34:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,第3层
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.84,0:34:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 第3层了！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.15,0:34:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.65,0:34:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.82,0:34:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.72,0:34:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,能进吗 进啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.19,0:34:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我进啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.49,0:35:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.99,0:35:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.51,0:35:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么！好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.64,0:35:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一千万
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.31,0:35:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.68,0:35:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天和它同生死
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.12,0:35:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,装载完成
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.36,0:35:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能输
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.59,0:35:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没理由会输
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.43,0:35:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的两千万是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.46,0:35:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抚恤金扣除养育费后的血本啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.73,0:35:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的全部啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.81,0:35:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,第2层
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.38,0:35:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.05,0:36:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,中了就赢了 和家人在一起的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.36,0:36:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,中了就赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.33,0:36:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,老婆 孩子 我的生活！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.57,0:36:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,第3层
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.13,0:36:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.14,0:36:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.34,0:36:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.87,0:36:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.28,0:36:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔最后的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.98,0:36:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.08,0:36:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,进啊！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.82,0:36:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.03,0:36:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.20,0:36:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,假的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.77,0:36:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,假的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.04,0:36:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能！？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.32,0:37:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.29,0:37:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,客人 您没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.23,0:37:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,客人 您没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.96,0:37:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒 钢珠还有剩余
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.20,0:37:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,您别放弃 再次决一胜负吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.37,0:37:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩余的86个
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.11,0:37:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经不可能了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.35,0:37:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不妙了 现在被他拿起来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.32,0:37:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就证据确凿 最差的结局
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.50,0:37:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.64,0:37:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个啤酒罐 有什么问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.20,0:37:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊不
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.21,0:38:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说回来 为了防止磁力
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.34,0:38:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,本店的钢珠
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.41,0:38:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,采用钢铁制和黄铜制两种
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.41,0:38:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,随机使用的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.52,0:38:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.75,0:38:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄铜？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.77,0:38:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道说
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.28,0:38:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,您猜的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.18,0:38:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,石田裕美 背叛了你们
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.66,0:38:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.72,0:38:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.53,0:39:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有办法
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.70,0:39:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有办法？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.07,0:39:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.91,0:39:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,付出了全部财产啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.18,0:39:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.08,0:39:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全部的希望啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.78,0:39:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给我 把钱还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.29,0:39:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.32,0:39:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.02,0:39:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钱还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.59,0:39:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,败者失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.63,0:39:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最理所应当的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.63,0:39:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,话虽如此
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.87,0:39:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们做的也相当不错
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.84,0:39:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样如何
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.61,0:39:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想给你个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.01,0:39:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,机会？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.28,0:39:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加另外一个游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.88,0:39:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美成功的话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.02,0:39:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你3千万
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.95,0:39:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,3千万
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.42,0:39:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意 什么都做
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.83,0:40:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.66,0:40:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊藤开司
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.97,0:40:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想见你很久了 一直以来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.14,0:40:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.24,0:40:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了救地下的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.01,0:40:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 别傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.45,0:40:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是 那样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.78,0:40:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.32,0:40:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个女的背叛他的原因在于她的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.29,0:40:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,死的时候留下一堆债务
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.53,0:40:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不止如此
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.03,0:40:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对她隐瞒了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.64,0:40:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.78,0:40:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,铁骨桥上和石田大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.12,0:40:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 和你的父亲是一起的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.79,0:41:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.80,0:41:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没能
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.40,0:41:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没能救得了大叔 让他掉了下去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.10,0:41:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的 非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.07,0:41:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.14,0:41:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是带着对大叔 和死去大家的怀念
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.01,0:41:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,同帝爱持续战斗的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.08,0:41:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次也是为了地下的大伙 再一次向帝爱
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.32,0:41:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.39,0:41:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不对
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.35,0:41:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了石田的就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.86,0:41:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.72,0:41:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.73,0:41:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把死去的人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.93,0:41:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,的人当做垫脚石
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.76,0:41:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样才从铁骨桥上活了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.97,0:41:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 我那个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.28,0:42:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是为自己而战斗的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.65,0:42:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你战斗是为了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.62,0:42:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己能活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.29,0:42:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次 还是会成为垫脚石
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.56,0:42:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.86,0:42:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧那种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.03,0:42:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何时候我都等着你 这场赌博
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.90,0:43:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.94,0:43:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔 我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.18,0:43:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.98,0:43:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,普通的柏青哥呀原来是
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.65,0:43:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你还想用剩下的钱翻本啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.36,0:43:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.66,0:43:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不吉利不吉利 运气都跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.86,0:43:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么嘛 都已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.30,0:43:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.37,0:43:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别捡
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.84,0:43:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的钢珠 别捡
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.74,0:43:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.86,0:43:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊别捡
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.70,0:43:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 为了我 别捡
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.53,0:44:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 果然 我还以为有什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.40,0:44:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.37,0:44:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为有什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.94,0:44:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么过激的反应
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.48,0:44:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这钱是真正最后最后的钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.08,0:44:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的棺材本200万啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.55,0:44:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何都不能动它
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.35,0:44:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这笔钱花光了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.82,0:44:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就什么都没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.36,0:44:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也没拿它不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.27,0:44:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还留有通往胜利的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.24,0:44:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.18,0:44:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,借用一下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.98,0:44:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.36,0:44:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出现在这里就是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.66,0:45:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然是冲着沼泽来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.93,0:45:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.87,0:45:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,利根川
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.94,0:45:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,来解释一下
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.51,0:45:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.82,0:45:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来说明一下你为什么很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.32,0:45:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.79,0:45:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在玩ECARD的时候输了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.26,0:45:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给 帝爱集团造成了5亿日圆的巨大损失
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.13,0:45:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,损害了会长的名誉
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.31,0:45:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那次胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.77,0:45:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己的地位和全部财产
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.94,0:45:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,都输掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.12,0:46:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果开司你挑战沼泽的话
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.22,0:46:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,能减轻我的怨恨
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.42,0:46:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.59,0:46:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只有这样做了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.68,0:46:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我换钱
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.48,0:46:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚剩下的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.02,0:46:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,放回机器里
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.70,0:46:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,支配沼泽的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.77,0:46:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不让他中
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.07,0:46:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就百分之百不会中
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.28,0:46:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样就好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.62,0:47:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,能行 绝对能行
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.76,0:47:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是问题是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.06,0:47:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.86,0:47:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.88,0:47:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 最重要的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.48,0:47:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对面那个大厦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.48,0:47:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该一年前就起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.82,0:47:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么还在施工呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.29,0:47:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为很严重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.16,0:47:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个大厦门建好后 就打不开
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.20,0:47:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 这个事 能详细点告诉我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.04,0:47:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.94,0:48:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴啊 怎么才能真正实施呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.14,0:48:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却是个天才想法啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.28,0:48:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准行得通 开司
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.48,0:48:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,长年从事现场监督的 我认为没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.58,0:48:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.75,0:48:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 钱的问题怎么解决呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.76,0:48:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备也要大把钱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.89,0:48:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 沼泽攻略的实施
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.53,0:48:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少要2千万
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.07,0:48:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩下 7天23小时
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.24,0:48:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.25,0:48:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要干
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.65,0:48:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.09,0:48:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要干
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.49,0:48:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有其他方法了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.07,0:49:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.17,0:49:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,新勇者之路 正在开放中
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.48,0:49:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这大楼有地下的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.31,0:49:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Princess and Slavery
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.54,0:49:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主和奴隶
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.05,0:49:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主和
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.92,0:49:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,奴隶
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.40,0:50:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位来宾 让您久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.40,0:50:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.34,0:50:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的游戏开始
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.15,0:50:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久以前，在某处有一个国家的国王
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.48,0:50:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在某处有一个国家的国王
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.85,0:50:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有个美丽的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.96,0:50:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一个奴隶相爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.29,0:50:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,利根川
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.29,0:50:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,王面对三扇门 让奴隶站在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.56,0:50:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.73,0:50:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一扇门的背后是 美丽的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.55,0:51:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着 另外2扇门的里面
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.28,0:51:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,摁下三个按钮中的一个
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.59,0:51:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,选对公主的门则完美生还
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.76,0:51:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 选择了狮子的门就…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.79,0:51:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,惨不忍睹的事态…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.96,0:51:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.47,0:51:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么接下来 勇敢的挑战者
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.00,0:51:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为奴隶 登场的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.95,0:52:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.91,0:52:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟这沼泽赌博的小哥吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.79,0:52:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夏
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.46,0:52:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜君
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.96,0:52:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在沼泽赌博中负债的他 对我说
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.76,0:52:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要和相爱的人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.03,0:52:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,分开
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.07,0:52:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要和相爱的人分开 还不如去死
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.51,0:52:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.74,0:52:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不能去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.95,0:52:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.65,0:52:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,结婚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.76,0:52:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了还清债务
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.86,0:52:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.83,0:52:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.77,0:52:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要胜君在
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.64,0:52:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱我都可以不要
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.41,0:53:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,来告诉我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.72,0:53:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,几号
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.83,0:53:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,摁啊 摁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.00,0:53:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,摁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.88,0:53:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,1号
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.12,0:53:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.17,0:54:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点没变
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.74,0:54:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是过去的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.41,0:54:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都没有人性
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.68,0:54:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.95,0:54:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她获得300万奖金
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.49,0:54:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了大家尽兴
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.12,0:54:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.69,0:54:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一名挑战者
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.57,0:54:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.40,0:54:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们做的不是人事
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.07,0:54:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.47,0:54:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.64,0:54:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.54,0:54:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶诶
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.14,0:54:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.52,0:54:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.99,0:54:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,被吃了怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.96,0:55:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来这位男人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.17,0:55:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊藤开司
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.64,0:55:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是 美丽的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.34,0:55:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个瘟神！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.97,0:55:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会出现在这
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.41,0:55:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对于这个游戏来说很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.11,0:55:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.21,0:55:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在沼泽中的一个
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.32,0:55:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲之死
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.52,0:56:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,和开司还挺有缘
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.96,0:56:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,父女都认识开司 此外还准备了另一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.70,0:56:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运是多么的捉弄
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.57,0:56:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,两年前 就是这个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.44,0:56:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,将公主的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.27,0:56:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,从地上300米的高处的铁桥推了下去
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.38,0:56:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,害其身亡的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.88,0:56:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.12,0:56:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲被害的美丽公主
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.32,0:56:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,会原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.16,0:56:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,会原谅这黑心的奴隶吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.66,0:56:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,亦或是奋勇的 与狮子为敌？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.30,0:56:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,让其成为狮子的美食呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.10,0:56:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.04,0:56:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.36,0:57:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能告诉我真相
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.19,0:57:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用的 开司
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.80,0:57:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙不会帮你的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.76,0:57:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.40,0:57:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能 在这里结束
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.48,0:57:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.95,0:57:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.52,0:57:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司 是2号
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.20,0:57:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司 是2号
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.87,0:57:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 再也能不再做这种事了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.57,0:57:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.37,0:58:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,船井
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.94,0:58:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这次 我来做你的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.08,0:58:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.88,0:58:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在希望号上 骗我的事你都忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.35,0:58:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还说那个干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.42,0:58:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我啊 来到地下的那天起
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.95,0:58:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只有对帝爱的恨
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.09,0:58:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.32,0:58:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,从早到晚的干活
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.06,0:58:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.86,0:58:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,寒酸的淋浴
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.23,0:58:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,和垃圾一起同眠
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.36,0:58:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,被当做畜生对待
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.40,0:58:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.44,0:58:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要相信我这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.37,0:58:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对帝爱的恨 无法用言语表达
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.07,0:58:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你一定要相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.54,0:58:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.14,0:58:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,选2号
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.15,0:58:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.78,0:58:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,2号啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.38,0:58:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.52,0:58:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.35,0:58:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.55,0:58:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.79,0:58:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道说
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.46,0:58:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,船井真的想帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.56,0:58:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.67,0:59:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,3号
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.54,0:59:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我明白了 是1号
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.68,0:59:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.31,0:59:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错的 就是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.65,0:59:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个下品的关西男 不可信
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.92,0:59:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女的也靠不住
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.25,0:59:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗我两千万的大坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.95,0:59:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以两个人都不可信
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.72,0:59:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的只有1号了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.02,0:59:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司 按1号
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.69,0:59:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.86,0:59:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的要选2 要选2
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.50,0:59:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,要选2 2
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.70,0:59:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不能听那下品关西男的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.63,0:59:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司开司 是1号
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.07,0:59:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,2 2
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.80,0:59:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,2 绝对是1 2 是2
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.97,0:59:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.64,0:59:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.71,0:59:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是3号
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.54,0:59:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,1 1 1 1 1
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.01,0:59:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,2 2 2 2
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.95,0:59:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,选1
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.18,0:59:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这我 选2
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.91,0:59:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司 选1
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.62,0:59:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,2 是2
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.35,0:59:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司 是2号
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.05,0:59:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司 我再说一次 是1号
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.29,0:59:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司 是1号
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.16,0:59:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我住口
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.12,1:00:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,1 1 1 1 1
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.33,1:00:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 看这我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.86,1:00:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.76,1:00:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.93,1:00:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑一下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.26,1:00:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.20,1:00:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是有胜算的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.90,1:00:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须考脑袋取胜
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.77,1:00:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,2 开司
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.74,1:00:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,决断的时候最重要的是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.18,1:00:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是觉悟！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.85,1:00:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.79,1:00:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是觉悟！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.49,1:00:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了觉悟就快点 摁下按钮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.11,1:00:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用想了 是1
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.32,1:01:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 是2呀
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.14,1:01:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊.按了3
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.20,1:01:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.40,1:01:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.27,1:01:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.34,1:01:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了！ 哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.34,1:02:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶为什么是3号
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.95,1:02:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你 别以为这样就完了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.35,1:02:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是地狱的开始
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.15,1:02:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.95,1:02:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 小力一点 啊 温柔一点
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.28,1:02:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的好 干的好 开司
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.02,1:02:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真害怕那女人说谎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.25,1:02:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是恐怖啊啊 哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.46,1:02:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.96,1:02:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这句不会
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.56,1:02:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.17,1:02:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个男人的指示我一定会服从
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.27,1:02:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你一定会怀疑我的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.47,1:03:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么追随那样的男人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.44,1:03:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这边
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.86,1:03:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我看了 很好的一幕
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.10,1:03:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你一个忠告
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.84,1:03:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要去挑战沼泽
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.34,1:03:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢了还好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.48,1:03:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,输了的话
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.59,1:03:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,输了的话要接受全灭的惩罚
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.89,1:03:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.56,1:03:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 只能赢不能输
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.89,1:03:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.40,1:04:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.37,1:04:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 好喝
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.81,1:04:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.71,1:04:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,买点下酒菜喝的也爽啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.81,1:04:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.49,1:04:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.96,1:04:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟踪来的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.86,1:04:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他手里拿了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.43,1:04:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是武器吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.27,1:04:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你果然来了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.93,1:04:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.11,1:04:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司 恭喜生还 你合格了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.14,1:04:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你当做我的同伴
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.94,1:04:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么一回事
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.15,1:04:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主与奴隶游戏中 是他给我发出提示
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.21,1:04:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才得救的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.85,1:04:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一是勇气 二是胆量 三是觉悟
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.55,1:04:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是觉悟！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.26,1:05:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了觉悟就快点 摁下按钮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.63,1:05:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那裕美的正确
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.10,1:05:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,…喂 别随便乱碰
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.53,1:05:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙也要攻略沼泽了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.47,1:05:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将为我指路
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.27,1:05:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,提供资金 帮助我获得赏金
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.10,1:05:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.41,1:05:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 像你这样的人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.74,1:05:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会相信你啊 像你这样的男人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.78,1:05:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都不会相信你的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.78,1:05:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.51,1:05:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾经是那个地下赌场的人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.78,1:05:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很多情报噢
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.65,1:05:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.75,1:05:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有天才般的沼泽轮盘攻略哦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.82,1:05:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻略轮盘的准备已经做好了？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.59,1:05:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 这个钉子森林呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.69,1:05:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然的了 不然的话三千万也是白搭
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.60,1:05:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.10,1:05:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.47,1:05:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会用这个啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.64,1:05:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种东西怎么会用啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.08,1:05:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.48,1:05:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是么 猜错了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.01,1:05:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我把这东西 带回给一条
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.25,1:05:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,向他进言吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.35,1:05:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.62,1:06:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔 都说叫你不要这么过激反应了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.49,1:06:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司君…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.19,1:06:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是肯定有的吧 跨越障碍的方法
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.36,1:06:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.50,1:06:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.43,1:07:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.40,1:07:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,花了2年时间
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.41,1:07:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然有这样
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.79,1:07:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然 是地下的人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.59,1:07:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,欠款还有大约4000万左右
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.46,1:07:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么会在地上
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.63,1:07:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.60,1:07:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为优秀啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.77,1:07:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起地下的人 我更喜欢驱使地上的人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.70,1:08:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个船井就是这样的人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.77,1:08:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.18,1:08:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为帝爱的奴隶 这一点是不变的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.79,1:08:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.93,1:08:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.40,1:08:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是 从帝爱逃出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.11,1:08:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,到什么时候才能到手啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.48,1:08:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,下周？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.01,1:08:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行不行
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.21,1:08:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,后天之前可不可以
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.58,1:08:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 帮我赶工一下
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.79,1:08:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.19,1:08:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.89,1:08:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责的部分可是沼泽攻略中
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.09,1:08:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的部分
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.49,1:08:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的部门
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.70,1:09:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然要多注意一点的了 哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.56,1:09:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 你回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.80,1:09:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.70,1:09:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 啊 让你买这么多东西
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.90,1:09:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个花瓶 有了它 花也有摆放的地方了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.07,1:09:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.24,1:09:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你的帮忙了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.11,1:09:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.95,1:09:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 该要确认一下
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.22,1:09:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,作战负责内容了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.59,1:09:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.16,1:09:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,裕美也来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.19,1:09:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈攻略战术吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.49,1:09:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,多个人多份力嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.46,1:09:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.34,1:09:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想还是不参加了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.54,1:09:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘记被我 欺骗的事情了么
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.95,1:09:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,裕美
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.18,1:09:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是一条逼你做的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.81,1:09:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,除此之外 我还有许多别的事情要做啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.95,1:09:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,光是收拾这间脏乱的屋子 就不知道要花多久了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.95,1:09:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 就先这么定了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.86,1:10:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有煤油要去买
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.97,1:10:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么开始吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.44,1:10:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认一下钉林的攻略
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.01,1:10:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的会来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.18,1:10:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,会来的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.52,1:10:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那群家伙 就只剩这一招了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.34,1:10:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么的这座大楼
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.52,1:11:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是搬家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.42,1:11:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,村上
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.26,1:11:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天也没什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.33,1:11:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你… 你也可以走了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.93,1:11:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.63,1:11:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.75,1:11:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,地上的时间只剩今天了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.01,1:11:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时之后 一切就都尘埃落定了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.62,1:11:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就用尽全力吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.86,1:12:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,归根到底 是一群没有未来的人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.76,1:12:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,凑到一起
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.00,1:12:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我让你们丑态百出
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.27,1:12:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后让你知道自己的错误
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.37,1:13:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘记你4千万的欠款了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.07,1:13:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不了的话 会逮捕你的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.28,1:13:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,会还的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.35,1:13:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这台沼泽吐出来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.38,1:13:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以得到13亿以上
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.85,1:13:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.49,1:13:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底 坑害了多少人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.62,1:13:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查正常
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.50,1:13:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就会让你明白
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.37,1:13:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于你的傲慢 轻敌
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.68,1:13:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,给这沼泽带来的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.88,1:13:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可乘之机
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.45,1:13:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到 The Swap of Pleasures
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.82,1:13:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,装载完成
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.53,1:13:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.43,1:14:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.71,1:14:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,钉子的设定使钢珠进的更加容易 明明是C级
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.84,1:14:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 为什么会这样进得去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.65,1:14:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,第1层
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.58,1:14:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.60,1:14:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,势头不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.17,1:14:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 但是游戏要中止
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.64,1:14:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,装扮成搬家员工 潜入大厦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.48,1:14:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,利根川做了手脚
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.65,1:14:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,悄悄的把钢珠换成小号的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.55,1:14:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,再放回原位
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.72,1:14:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.85,1:14:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,出老千的没收全部财产
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.89,1:15:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且逮捕这2人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.19,1:15:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,从刚才就不明白 你说的是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.50,1:15:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的保密工作做的不好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.93,1:15:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你看看证据
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.31,1:15:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.31,1:15:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,花瓶
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.01,1:15:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我放的花瓶里
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.02,1:15:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,放进了这个
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.09,1:15:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.22,1:15:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.83,1:15:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都记录在内
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.46,1:15:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.76,1:15:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,裕美 不是背叛了帝爱吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.90,1:15:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有背叛
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.67,1:15:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.77,1:15:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.77,1:15:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.90,1:15:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的愚蠢是天生的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.11,1:15:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这在说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.77,1:15:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全没有理解这个女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.58,1:15:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个时候 这个女所说的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.55,1:15:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是受一条指示的 目的就是摧毁开司
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.89,1:16:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个女的就是条蛇
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.09,1:16:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直不变 不曾动摇的蛇
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.39,1:16:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么说的话就是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.13,1:16:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实我是条蛇
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.57,1:16:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想输 不
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.10,1:16:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,想赢的更痛快 仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.74,1:16:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直站在胜率 更高的一边
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.88,1:16:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在更强的一边
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.51,1:16:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是对你问题的 答案
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.15,1:16:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我服从这个男人的理由
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.35,1:16:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.49,1:16:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话我想 再问一次
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.89,1:16:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.96,1:16:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要踩着别人 推下别人也要前进
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.70,1:16:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于原因 就是不想被人推
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.37,1:16:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想成为被推的那个
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.27,1:16:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.67,1:17:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像和那种傻瓜老爸 有一样的遭遇
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.61,1:17:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天工作在 满是油污的环境下
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.21,1:17:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像样子的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.88,1:17:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,像个过街老鼠一样
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.95,1:17:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是正直老实 懦弱 被骗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.32,1:17:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是为了债务低头
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.56,1:17:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会被欺负到死的 可怜的父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.60,1:17:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会让人笑话
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.50,1:17:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,被人嘲笑的人生
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.34,1:17:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的人生 我不想重蹈覆辙
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.71,1:17:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.82,1:17:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我变成这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.45,1:17:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.05,1:17:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.16,1:17:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.23,1:17:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.63,1:17:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,表情很对
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.90,1:17:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,同伴间的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.87,1:17:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,争执摩擦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.74,1:18:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好的表情
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.51,1:18:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.21,1:18:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.34,1:18:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还算是人吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.11,1:18:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.91,1:18:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多 该结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.25,1:18:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把3个人都送去地狱
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.02,1:18:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是钢珠的检查板
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.19,1:18:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,证据确凿的话
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.80,1:18:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,钢珠会穿过板子掉落下来
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.94,1:18:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,惨了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.87,1:18:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,假的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.98,1:18:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.02,1:18:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 根本就没有换过钢珠
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.46,1:18:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报也有出错的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.70,1:19:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没换过钢珠
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.33,1:19:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.14,1:19:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们 连我都骗了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.87,1:19:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.84,1:19:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,店长 那么是为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.68,1:19:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道说
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.28,1:19:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.22,1:19:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,主任
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.32,1:19:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你剩下的道路
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.12,1:19:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只有一生做帝爱的奴隶 劳作至死
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.25,1:19:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,和那个男人一起破灭吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.36,1:19:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.96,1:19:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢了这场赌博 我们还清债务
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.13,1:19:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,会给你自由的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.07,1:19:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么傻话啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.37,1:19:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.77,1:19:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,石田大叔他
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.81,1:19:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的最后
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.58,1:19:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把奖金给我了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.62,1:19:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要救你的不是我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.58,1:19:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.35,1:19:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.69,1:20:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在乎你
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.06,1:20:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想着你 担心你
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.83,1:20:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,比任何人都温柔
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.53,1:20:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到最后为止
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.90,1:20:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,石田大叔 就是这样一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.94,1:20:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,和大叔这么温柔相遇
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.57,1:20:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉我太微不足道了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.64,1:20:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.98,1:20:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.32,1:20:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不傻吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.82,1:20:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个货真价实的傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.32,1:20:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,做这种没用的事
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.82,1:20:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.13,1:20:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用再这么温柔了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.30,1:20:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.80,1:20:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,再决胜负吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.53,1:20:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.01,1:20:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天本来应该是设定C的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.88,1:21:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那些家伙没用小号的救轻易突破
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.29,1:21:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道说
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.03,1:21:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们钻了调整的空子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.56,1:21:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 是如何做到的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.99,1:21:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.50,1:21:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,第1层
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.57,1:21:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,第1层
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.23,1:21:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 很简单的事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.61,1:21:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,店长室的正上方
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.65,1:22:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地板上开了个洞
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.88,1:22:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后趁店长室没人的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.59,1:22:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,从缝隙间放下电磁装置
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.46,1:22:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,钓上设定C的铁棒
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.67,1:22:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把铁棒上面的小球
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.93,1:22:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,换成比实际 要小一号的小球
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.37,1:22:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,再放回原处
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.84,1:22:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使每天做这样的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.01,1:22:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会被发觉
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.01,1:22:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天不断用这个 进行间隔调整的大傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.29,1:22:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.30,1:22:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔 第二张
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.06,1:22:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.17,1:23:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.17,1:23:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,装载完成
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.02,1:23:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么办 这样下去
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.42,1:23:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,沼泽不是还有轮盘么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.75,1:23:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,钉林不管用了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.15,1:23:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有问题了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.02,1:23:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就样就没有问题了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.36,1:23:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的就是拜托轮盘了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.96,1:23:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该已经沉了吧 这个店的内部
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.47,1:23:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,沼泽的轮盘
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.57,1:23:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来就是被做了手脚的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.57,1:23:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一定的 倾斜
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.68,1:23:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了让第3层 最里面的入赏洞进不去球
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.78,1:23:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,倾斜局面就会造成拦截
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.12,1:23:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说轮盘是倾斜的生命线
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.92,1:23:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.76,1:23:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了不让顾客理解那个倾斜 把所有的倾斜叠加在了一起
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.36,1:23:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一方面是轮盘
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.33,1:23:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一方面是机器本身
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.66,1:24:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后是
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.76,1:24:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,沼泽周围的地板吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.97,1:24:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.27,1:24:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注意到这点
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.18,1:24:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为看到想藏钱的大叔的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.28,1:24:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,过激举动
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.18,1:24:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的钢球 你不要捡
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.88,1:24:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,阪崎大叔
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.75,1:24:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒在地板的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.72,1:24:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条捡起了散落的钢珠
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.09,1:24:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是为了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.09,1:24:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不被发现地板倾斜的过激举动
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.95,1:24:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,客人 您没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.29,1:24:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.29,1:24:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他本来就没必要特意亲自去 拾起散落的钢珠
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.03,1:24:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.43,1:24:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 击破那个倾斜
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.63,1:24:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,也正是攻略三连轮盘的 唯一路径
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.10,1:24:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.17,1:24:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,第3层
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.58,1:24:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 上啊 第一次到达第3层
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.58,1:24:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的就是这个啦
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.28,1:24:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.69,1:24:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这个轨迹
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.29,1:24:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,进啊 进吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.99,1:25:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.53,1:25:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样是可行的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.60,1:25:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天有戏
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.77,1:25:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,小哥行得通哦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.90,1:25:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.17,1:25:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出来
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.48,1:25:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.51,1:25:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是好好地调整好的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.08,1:25:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么爬上去了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.65,1:25:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓一跳吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.39,1:25:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于意识到了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.52,1:25:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个异变
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.77,1:25:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般的地板 是不应该这样倾斜的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.08,1:25:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么说
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.28,1:25:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们放弃了 改变轮盘的倾斜
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.61,1:25:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,将楼层整体直接…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.35,1:26:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.09,1:26:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.69,1:26:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 大楼本身在倾斜
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.50,1:26:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下赌场 附近的在建工程
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.17,1:26:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为地基下沉 正在做修复工作
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.94,1:26:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说那个赌场 附近的地基很松
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.47,1:26:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.04,1:26:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真实天助我们啊 我的强运
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.84,1:26:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.04,1:26:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么庞大的工程是怎样…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.65,1:26:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这个倾斜怎么解释
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.52,1:26:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是水
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.45,1:26:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,7层的房间里放上塑料箱
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.79,1:26:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,再用水管向里面注水
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.86,1:26:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,注满1000公升的水
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.36,1:26:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 花8个小时来摆放
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.03,1:26:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,20个
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.60,1:26:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,总计20吨水的重量
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.94,1:26:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样一来
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.25,1:27:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,上啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.52,1:27:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 他们让这个大楼反方向倾斜了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.76,1:27:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以将轮盘数值调到…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.53,1:27:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的 倾斜加到最大来对抗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.80,1:27:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那样并不十分有效
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.80,1:27:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻档不了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.27,1:27:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.97,1:28:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来用这个
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.64,1:28:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.51,1:28:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,装载完成，相信你的命运
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.78,1:28:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,能撑得过去吗 这个样子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.35,1:28:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩一千万
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.32,1:28:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.73,1:28:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？ 把数值调反吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.73,1:28:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样 落入第3层
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.70,1:28:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入入赏洞就是 一条直线了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.77,1:28:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.02,1:28:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 反向调整的话
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.79,1:28:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一二层就不容易掉下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.79,1:28:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.53,1:29:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.23,1:29:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 也不一定
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.73,1:29:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果第3层的钢珠进了的话
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.24,1:29:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.04,1:29:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我拿过来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.44,1:29:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是但是那个太过露骨 用了的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.45,1:29:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我拿来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.78,1:29:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果进洞的话
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.85,1:29:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你我都完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.09,1:29:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.66,1:29:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道打算用那个？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.99,1:29:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做的话 沼泽的梦想 幻想就消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.30,1:29:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这赌场就末路了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.14,1:29:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 怎么就抵达不到
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.77,1:29:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.81,1:29:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再撑一会
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.78,1:29:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在“奇风”到达之前
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.12,1:29:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,到啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.45,1:29:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,到啊 到达啊 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.76,1:30:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑住 撑住
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.56,1:30:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我撑住
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.53,1:30:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后了 冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.14,1:30:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.54,1:30:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.18,1:30:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,能赢
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.65,1:30:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,能赢
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.52,1:30:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,进啊 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.89,1:30:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.56,1:30:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.32,1:30:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.13,1:30:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 呜哇
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.24,1:30:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一条
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.48,1:30:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.84,1:30:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要赢了 却被运气抛弃了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.58,1:30:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,畜生
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.48,1:30:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.78,1:31:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.42,1:31:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.29,1:31:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么就抵达不到
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.12,1:31:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.81,1:31:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.94,1:31:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗憾啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.88,1:31:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不遗憾
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.68,1:31:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要的是钱
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.01,1:31:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着我
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.08,1:31:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔 利根川
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.38,1:31:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小哥 应该还留有一手的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.29,1:31:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,手头的钱 全部打出？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.86,1:31:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这样的衰仔 别想坑我的钱了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.77,1:31:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,能赢的 这样继续打下去的话
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.80,1:31:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.54,1:31:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.47,1:31:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.81,1:31:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听我的胜算
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.91,1:32:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论敌人怎么出招 也一定能赢的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.14,1:32:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有绝对能赢的现象
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.41,1:32:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩231发
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.98,1:32:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.98,1:32:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.29,1:32:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.22,1:32:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.06,1:32:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那也不是绝对
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.69,1:32:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次的话 就可以进了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.16,1:32:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.53,1:32:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我从地下带上来的全部财产
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.84,1:32:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,109万
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.10,1:32:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 104万
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.81,1:32:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.88,1:32:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,借我你们的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.65,1:32:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.62,1:32:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后的200万
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.25,1:32:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这里输了的话 我就滚蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.39,1:32:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,拼了 哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.09,1:32:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你大叔
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.23,1:32:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 都到这里了 你还打算逃走吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.56,1:32:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱不够啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.30,1:32:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束啦 够清楚了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.23,1:32:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.17,1:33:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.44,1:33:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙 还有4千万的债务呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.91,1:33:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,打沼泽不中的话 立刻就会被送去地下
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.21,1:33:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.05,1:33:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你还是一点没变
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.42,1:33:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,太过乐观
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.67,1:33:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,利根川怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.04,1:33:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃走了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.90,1:33:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正会被抓住的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.81,1:33:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司君…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.14,1:33:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙伴一个个的消失呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.78,1:33:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新装载
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.15,1:33:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就300万 你打算干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.82,1:33:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场胜负 是我的胜利了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.09,1:33:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一定哦
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.13,1:33:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,钢珠变多了呢 诶
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.06,1:34:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,从外泄洞冒上来了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.17,1:34:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,第1层
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.18,1:34:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 下往上的倒跑
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.21,1:34:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.08,1:34:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.72,1:34:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会有这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.19,1:34:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.49,1:34:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,往里面倾斜过头了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.69,1:34:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,平常
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.86,1:34:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,倾斜的话
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.13,1:34:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以很轻松的吐出
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.83,1:34:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是开司把大厦 反向倾斜了让轮盘变水平了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.97,1:34:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条再次的 内侧倾斜就使得内侧堵塞了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.87,1:34:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,钢珠没能吐出
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.41,1:34:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,堆积而上越过了轮盘
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.91,1:34:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧接着
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.35,1:34:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,钢珠
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.75,1:34:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,过线了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.89,1:34:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 已死的钢珠又
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.72,1:35:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟 没有外泄洞了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.63,1:35:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,持续打的话一定会连续入洞的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.26,1:35:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅第2层
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.13,1:35:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,第3层也是必然啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.87,1:35:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.00,1:35:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰 别碰
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.67,1:35:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,违反规则啊你
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.75,1:35:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.35,1:35:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点拿过来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.42,1:35:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,所剩的钢珠不多了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.13,1:35:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不了多久就攻陷了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.66,1:35:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 开司
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.80,1:35:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚下一个个的小钢珠
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.17,1:35:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是败者的不甘 怨恨的眼泪啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.27,1:35:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场胜负啊 已经不只是我们的问题了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.94,1:35:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是被击败的人们的心啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.81,1:35:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.31,1:35:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要给我赢啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.33,1:36:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,第2层
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.49,1:36:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.80,1:36:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,2 哇
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.10,1:36:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.41,1:36:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.78,1:36:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,进啊 进吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.86,1:36:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.30,1:36:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.24,1:37:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.61,1:37:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,输了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.82,1:37:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊藤开司
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.35,1:37:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点把余下的钢珠打完
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.66,1:37:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还很早的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.72,1:37:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,打完了 留在地上的意义也没了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.53,1:37:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接到命令立刻逮捕你
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.93,1:37:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.41,1:37:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,呐 呐 一条
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.08,1:37:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条 如何啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.55,1:37:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个提议
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.08,1:37:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是也不是
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.45,1:37:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之百
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.99,1:37:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么也说不定
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.89,1:37:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.49,1:37:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.46,1:37:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 一条
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.06,1:37:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们算平手怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.80,1:37:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.54,1:38:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看不是还剩下61个嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.57,1:38:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,1发按400万来买下
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.87,1:38:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共2亿4400万
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.74,1:38:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那虽然不是大奖 但大家的欠款也能还清
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.48,1:38:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,呐 怎样 那样挺好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.55,1:38:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,呐 呐
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.15,1:38:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能平手啊
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.19,1:38:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.15,1:38:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你已经输了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.09,1:38:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,输了输了输了输了输了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.53,1:38:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快打
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.76,1:38:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后快点结束
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.60,1:38:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想 回地下
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.90,1:38:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.03,1:38:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.37,1:38:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,打呀开司
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.37,1:38:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点打
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.07,1:38:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后降到地狱去
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.58,1:38:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.88,1:38:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要 放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.40,1:39:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜负还没完呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.74,1:39:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,利根川
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.34,1:39:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.18,1:39:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了车站一掏口袋
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.25,1:39:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现只有120块
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.88,1:39:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,连坐地铁都不够
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.82,1:39:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是呢 口袋里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.89,1:39:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这个东西
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.86,1:39:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用了这个啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.63,1:39:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让员工也持卡 真是失败的规定啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.63,1:39:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是沉是浮 这就是最后了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.80,1:39:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这一千万决一胜负吧 开司
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.67,1:39:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,利根川
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.98,1:39:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.51,1:39:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.92,1:40:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 结束啦
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.66,1:40:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.66,1:40:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,输了？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.77,1:40:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.80,1:40:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.70,1:40:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.24,1:40:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,第3层
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.14,1:40:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 冲啊 冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.68,1:40:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.78,1:40:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.01,1:40:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.12,1:40:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.19,1:40:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.53,1:40:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.87,1:40:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶上了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.30,1:40:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,“奇风”
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.84,1:40:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 诶
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.65,1:40:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.62,1:41:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道说
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.52,1:41:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.65,1:41:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,风
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.12,1:41:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,太卑弊了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.79,1:41:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,开挂
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.83,1:41:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.46,1:41:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不切实际啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.93,1:41:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.97,1:41:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.84,1:41:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.68,1:41:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然是出老千啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.24,1:41:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,出老千啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.88,1:41:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有人再打柏青哥了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.71,1:41:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有人 再打柏青哥了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.05,1:41:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为已经坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.29,1:41:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.09,1:41:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在无论用什么手段都是要赢
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.26,1:41:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要赢
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.03,1:41:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧 钢珠增多了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.10,1:41:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,挤啊 第3层也挤进去 进去
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.84,1:41:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊 开司
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.67,1:41:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,挤进去
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.51,1:41:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.22,1:42:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 请您再等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.09,1:42:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走这个工厂的话 我就走投无路了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.02,1:42:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要让我们再等啊
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.16,1:42:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是是的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.70,1:42:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,石田先生
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.87,1:42:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身处危难 说一句话
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.27,1:42:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会预定的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.17,1:42:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然都不是有钱人
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.67,1:42:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是每人凑一点 还是有一些的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.31,1:42:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不能让大家这样做
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.38,1:42:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都这么艰难了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.41,1:42:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.25,1:42:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了救人
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.85,1:42:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己也被拖下水
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.82,1:42:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.32,1:42:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了救这个人
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.96,1:42:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次被拖下水
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.67,1:43:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.54,1:43:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.85,1:43:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当了垫脚石吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.85,1:43:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的推了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.05,1:43:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺利的话 没准能还清全部债务
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.19,1:43:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别一副担心的样子嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.63,1:43:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.03,1:43:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,走好
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.74,1:43:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走啦
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.94,1:43:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.51,1:43:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,从铁骨桥上推下来
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.19,1:43:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千万够不够啊
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.96,1:43:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,落进最后的洞里
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.49,1:44:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.40,1:44:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司 中啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.23,1:44:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.04,1:44:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.44,1:44:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 可恶 来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.94,1:44:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我变成这样的那个男人
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.05,1:44:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.79,1:44:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信他吗
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.27,1:44:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的那个人
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.10,1:45:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.63,1:45:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了 来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.40,1:45:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.24,1:45:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.00,1:45:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.64,1:45:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.39,1:45:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.19,1:45:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.57,1:45:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.84,1:45:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.84,1:45:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,度过了勇者之路又怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.18,1:45:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不过如此
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.81,1:46:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼狈啊 可怜的结局
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.92,1:46:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦吗
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.19,1:46:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是梦吗
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.92,1:46:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是梦 是现实
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.63,1:46:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真实的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.63,1:46:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 把他打回地狱
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.40,1:46:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 放开我 已经不想再回到地下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.04,1:46:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊 啊 还有钱
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.77,1:46:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我 还没有定胜负呢
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.47,1:46:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,来来 一条 钱的话我还有
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.44,1:46:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱的话我还有 一条 来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.04,1:46:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真寒碜
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.45,1:46:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,最低300万
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.31,1:46:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么点钱真是不像话
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.82,1:46:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失吧
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.55,1:46:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我 谁来救救我
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.15,1:46:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 谁可以借我一点钱
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.89,1:46:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,借 借给我钱 一条
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.26,1:46:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好好好
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.46,1:46:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道没有看明白吗 就差一步
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.93,1:46:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔 救救我
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.83,1:46:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我 哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.63,1:46:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我决一胜负
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.54,1:46:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我决一胜负
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.10,1:46:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.30,1:46:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,裕美
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.04,1:47:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…的失败 是要去地下劳动的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.88,1:47:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我心情好 给你特别的…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.25,1:47:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 那个
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.33,1:47:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,用吧
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.17,1:47:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.41,1:47:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.31,1:47:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你的债务清零
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.51,1:47:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 把卡交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.75,1:47:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在输了的话 我也会送去地下劳动
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.05,1:47:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那张卡怎么来的
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.72,1:47:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,呐 呐 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.56,1:47:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里也有一个笨蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.40,1:48:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 用了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.97,1:48:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用了啊 禁断的卡片
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.74,1:48:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那个地下ATM机
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.78,1:48:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 这次100%是不会行的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.08,1:48:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.25,1:48:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾经是那个地下赌场的人啊合适吗 这家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.12,1:48:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是对你父亲见死不救的人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.82,1:48:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他们
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.29,1:48:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得吗
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.73,1:48:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.41,1:48:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.18,1:48:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.71,1:48:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的那份
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.88,1:48:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.15,1:48:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.13,1:49:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔 行的 这样就行的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.97,1:49:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,第1层
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.51,1:49:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢啊开司
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.01,1:49:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管什么风
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.55,1:49:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇到什么不幸
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.18,1:49:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不要放弃
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.65,1:49:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.06,1:49:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢 我会赢
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.22,1:49:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.13,1:49:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种苦难
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.43,1:49:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,霉运
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.16,1:49:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸 不平等
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.30,1:49:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我都要赢
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.07,1:49:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,第3层，第3层
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.27,1:49:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,第3层
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.04,1:49:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.64,1:49:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.58,1:49:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 大家都帮他
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.35,1:49:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊！冲啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.05,1:49:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊！！！！！！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.52,1:50:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能在这种地方输的
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.23,1:50:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好不容易从地底下上来 爬到现在的位置
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.13,1:50:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,被好友所骗 借款的连带担保人
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.07,1:50:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你签的担保书
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.64,1:50:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,意识过来的时候 我已经在地底
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.95,1:50:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 别偷懒
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.08,1:50:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.25,1:50:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.65,1:50:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.29,1:50:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来 听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.99,1:50:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 马上
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.99,1:50:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这样的地底 也有帮助我的人
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.37,1:50:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.10,1:50:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.34,1:50:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.64,1:50:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡路啊
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.48,1:50:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 别碰我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.05,1:50:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮助过你吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.95,1:51:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我下去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.89,1:51:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,打算推的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.06,1:51:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.69,1:51:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 也打算推我的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.50,1:51:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.13,1:51:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么能让你得逞
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.50,1:51:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.64,1:51:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了活下去 是理所应当的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.04,1:51:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家推下别人 为保自已
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.41,1:51:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,说教 就职
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.41,1:51:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入公司开始争夺地位
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.45,1:51:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有事情 都是这样不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.15,1:51:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以为了胜利 我也这样做
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.05,1:51:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是正确的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.79,1:51:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也推了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.63,1:51:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 为什么 输给那样的垃圾
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.93,1:51:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,同伴
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.53,1:51:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,信赖？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.87,1:51:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.37,1:51:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些东西 那些东西应该是没有用的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.34,1:51:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样才对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.57,1:52:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就进了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.61,1:52:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司 马上就挤进去了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.01,1:52:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,第1层
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.01,1:52:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,第2层，第2层
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.82,1:52:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,第3层，第3层
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.89,1:52:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,挤进去
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.93,1:52:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,挤进去
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.79,1:52:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,挤进去
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.79,1:52:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,挤进去
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.44,1:52:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,挤进去 啊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.08,1:52:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.65,1:52:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.95,1:52:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的提议我接受
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.66,1:52:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,平手
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.46,1:52:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受平手的提案
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.93,1:52:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.03,1:52:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 只是救你们
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.47,1:53:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 我给你3亿
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.24,1:53:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把周围的人甩开
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.67,1:53:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.87,1:53:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下的同伴也是
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.42,1:53:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为就是这么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.42,1:53:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都只是在互相利用
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.12,1:53:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕就一点 时机到了也会铲除
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.89,1:53:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人就是
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.60,1:53:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,利根川被利用 或者被愚弄的
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.60,1:53:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.70,1:53:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以铲除啊
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.67,1:53:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要自己得救
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.44,1:53:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怜啊你
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.81,1:53:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下将希望交托给我的 E班的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.45,1:53:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地上帮助我的大家
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.79,1:53:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是比起任何财产 都更有价值的
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.12,1:53:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜过任何巨款
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.66,1:53:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因为有大家在 才能突破
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.89,1:54:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便是这难攻不落的 沼泽也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.91,1:54:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.34,1:54:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,被推的同伴就像这超越了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.54,1:54:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮盘的钢珠一样
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.57,1:54:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,第3层，第3层
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.74,1:54:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,第3层，第3层
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.55,1:54:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相推吧 推着脊背
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.02,1:55:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,支持着我
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.09,1:55:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,直至中奖
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.66,1:55:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒 吐出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.39,1:55:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坑骗的破产者的财产
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.86,1:55:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.10,1:55:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,魂魄
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.27,1:55:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望 失望 眼泪
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.10,1:55:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切全部都吐出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.27,1:55:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊 冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.52,1:55:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.65,1:55:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,进了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.95,1:55:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,涌进去啦
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.83,1:55:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 你是胜利者
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.91,1:56:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了 成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.20,1:56:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕一条圣也
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.03,1:56:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下劳动
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.10,1:56:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,1035年
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.22,1:57:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.59,1:57:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.25,1:57:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮捕命令
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.82,1:57:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要 不要啊
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.06,1:57:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 救救我 啊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.46,1:57:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自黑崎大人的 逮捕命令
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.21,1:57:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要回来
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.42,1:57:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的话 还可以再爬上来的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.49,1:57:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那个地下
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.36,1:57:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬上来
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.40,1:57:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次来
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.30,1:58:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,打败我
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.31,1:58:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,呐 呐
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.91,1:58:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.85,1:58:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用说我也会这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.48,1:58:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.69,1:58:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不认同 给我等着
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.93,1:58:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定再次回来
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.30,1:58:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次一定
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.13,1:58:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次 必然
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.17,1:59:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.97,1:59:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,13亿6429万
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.34,1:59:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,欠款扣除之后
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.74,1:59:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.08,1:59:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,1亿3957万
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.82,1:59:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,裕美
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.15,1:59:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,3亿297万
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.42,1:59:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,利根川
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.02,1:59:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,2亿9014万
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.56,1:59:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来我
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.66,1:59:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,3亿4074万
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.13,1:59:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,全员大丰收
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.97,1:59:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样人生就能再来一次了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.07,1:59:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.58,1:59:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的可以再来一次了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.91,2:00:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收拾好了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.71,2:00:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,先告别了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.64,2:00:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家生活愉快
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.72,2:00:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,再会
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.15,2:00:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我也告辞了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.16,2:00:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,呐
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.80,2:00:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.20,2:00:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在最后关头
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.24,2:00:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.15,2:01:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.42,2:01:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.52,2:01:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是永远选择站在 胜利的一方
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.13,2:01:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是如此
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.36,2:01:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲的心情
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.33,2:01:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于感受到了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.58,2:02:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.35,2:02:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,开司
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.96,2:02:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.33,2:02:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也走了啊
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.04,2:02:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下啊 开司
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.01,2:02:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,90
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.81,2:02:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是80
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.21,2:02:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.38,2:02:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,能打中沼泽 万万岁！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.82,2:02:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.52,2:02:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是百分之百
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.09,2:02:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,解放了地下的同伴之后 还剩下的1亿4千万
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.13,2:02:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你不般配啊 这笔巨款
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.77,2:03:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢掉算了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.97,2:03:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者现在
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.71,2:03:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,再赌一把
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.93,2:03:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.99,2:03:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的话 应该没人打扰吧
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.76,2:04:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我的最后的胜负
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.40,2:04:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,E CARD
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.76,2:04:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这次 我用奴隶就行
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.47,2:04:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,奴隶赢了的话是5倍的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.98,2:04:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 对 那么如何
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.53,2:04:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.34,2:04:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙真没注意到吗
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.34,2:04:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 赌一把
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.16,2:05:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一张 就他了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.96,2:05:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙选的是市民
Dialogue: 0,2:05:09.96,2:05:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这用皇帝的话就能赢
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.45,2:05:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 这是这家伙的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.88,2:05:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出奴隶的话我就输了
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.34,2:05:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再想想
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.56,2:05:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 出什么故障了 开司 出到外面去
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.12,2:05:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还来这手活啊
Dialogue: 0,2:05:43.98,2:05:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去之后就算我认输
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.84,2:05:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正这烟雾也是你装入的发烟装置什么的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.93,2:05:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.81,2:06:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好奇怪啊 怎话说起火了 把什么引燃了吧么不灵了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.52,2:06:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说起火了 把什么引燃了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.22,2:06:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,下了车就算输咯
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.24,2:06:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,放弃比赛就算输 说过的吧
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.35,2:06:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是说这种事的时候 快灭火啊你
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.70,2:06:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去就输啦利根川
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.99,2:06:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴啊你 里面有钱啊
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.28,2:06:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像玩的有点过火了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.74,2:06:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个不是把戏 是来真的
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.51,2:07:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了地下同伴被释放的时间了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.49,2:07:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我还打算把赢了的钱平分来着
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.02,2:07:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在哪还有脸啊
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.34,2:07:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用这样他们也十分感激了吧 毕竟得到解放了啊
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.00,2:07:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么总是这幅样子啊
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.05,2:07:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概大伙现在正在吃饭吧
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.23,2:07:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,解放庆祝会
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.18,2:07:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.54,2:07:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候的5万块
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.26,2:07:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别的还给你
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.50,2:07:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,利根川
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.81,2:08:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啦 快去吧
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.34,2:08:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.51,2:08:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯！！！
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.16,2:08:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉 开吃 哟！！！
